&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About CreativeX&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CreativeX is B2B SaaS technology platform that helps global marketing teams make smarter creative decisions and elevate creative expression through the clarity of data. Our technology powers creative decision-making at some of the biggest brands in the world, including Google, Unilever, Pepsi, Bayer, Mondelez, Heineken, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use computer vision and other machine learning techniques to extract creative data from our client&#39;s digital advertising copy and transform those previously dark signals into a standardised data model at industrial scale. This creates a new, unique and powerful first party data set that represents the last and most impactful untapped reservoir of advertising performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s because multiple studies have shown that the &quot;Creative&quot; itself is responsible for half of sales lift online, higher than reach, targeting, brand, &amp;amp; recency combined. But creative impact has always been the least analysed and least understood component of a complex set of marketing variables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the problem CreativeX is focussed on solving. We&#39;re an end-to-end solution to ingest, process, and analyse content at scale. We help brands isolate creative elements so they can be analysed against downstream ad impact metrics, from clickthrough rates to brand lift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our objective is to help marketing organisations power every creative decision with data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Design Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Designer, you&#39;ll help shape the next generation of the CreativeX platform, taking problems from discovery through to shipped experiences across defined areas of the product. You&#39;ll be the design lead in a product trio alongside a Product Manager and an Engineering Lead, owning whether users want what we build and whether they can figure out how to use it, while sharing discovery, outcomes and trade-offs with your partners. CreativeX is a complex product with rich data, multiple user types and increasingly sophisticated AI capabilities, and as AI increases the volume and speed of creative production, you&#39;ll make that complexity work for marketers, helping them measure performance fast, find the patterns behind what&#39;s working and see whether their full set of ads is delivering the strategy. Our roadmap is framed as problems to solve, not screens to make, so we expect you to bring a point of view. Product Design is a small, hands-on team in a scale-up: you&#39;ll be trusted with real ownership early, and this hire is an important step in growing the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own design for defined product areas, from understanding the problem through to working with Product and Engineering to ship the right experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get close to marketers and creative teams through customer conversations, research and usability testing, using what you learn to inform design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering in discovery to validate real problems, challenge assumptions and make sensible trade-offs between customer value, business needs and technical constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn creative data, insights and AI-powered capabilities into intuitive workflows, dashboards and decision-making tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for the platform, not just the feature, building on existing patterns and connecting experiences across CreativeX&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use and extend our design system, creating and documenting patterns and components so they&#39;re implemented consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar through strong interaction and visual design craft, and by giving and receiving feedback in critiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn from what you ship, using customer feedback, product data and research to improve the experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In your first 90 days&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn the CreativeX platform, our customers and our design system, and work as the design lead in your product trio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of a defined product area and ship, or get build-ready, your first piece of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our AI-powered product work and add to or improve patterns in our design system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join customer conversations and use what you hear to shape your design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In your first year&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own design for one or more product areas, taking work from discovery through to launch with little direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship work you can point to, using customer feedback and product data to show whether it solved the problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build out new parts of our design system and make the product feel more coherent across areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how design works at CreativeX as the team grows, including supporting newer designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of product design experience, with a portfolio that shows how you framed problems, explored options, made trade-offs and learned from what shipped&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interaction and visual design craft, confident in Figma, prototyping and design systems, and familiar with Slack and Linear&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using research, usability testing and customer feedback to inform design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems mindset and the ability to make complex information, workflows and data easy to understand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, collaborative communication: you challenge ideas constructively, take feedback well and know when to ship and learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with Product and Engineering in a product trio or small team, with real ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/em&gt; B2B SaaS, data-heavy or analytics products; marketing, advertising or martech; AI-powered products; mentoring junior designers; scale-up experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CreativeX, we encourage applicants of all backgrounds and identities to apply for roles that align with their own interests and career trajectory. If you fit the description above and see yourself in this role, we would love to see your application! &lt;em&gt;Unfortunately, we are unable to offer visa sponsorship at this time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍎 Private Medical Insurance and Health Cash Plan&lt;br&gt;✈️ Generous time off + bank holidays&lt;br&gt;📚 Education budget to be used for individual learning experiences or grouped with your team for joint learning&lt;br&gt;🧘 Annual subscription to Calm and Headspace for your mental wellbeing&lt;br&gt;🎟 Monthly coaching to talk to a trained professional about career goals, relationships, and personal development&lt;br&gt;💵 Competitive salary including stock options, as we believe that everyone should have a stake in the business&lt;br&gt;🍼 4-month full pay parenting leave for all employees who have been with the company for one (1) year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CreativeX provides equal employment opportunities for all applicants and employees.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our commitment to maintaining a safe and secure workplace, CreativeX conducts standard right to work and background checks on all potential employees. This process is designed to verify the accuracy of information provided by candidates and to ensure a safe environment for all employees. Background checks are conducted via a secure third party application and in compliance with all applicable laws and regulations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
