&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(40, 40, 40);&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our leading SaaS-based Global Employment Platform™ enables clients to expand into over 180 countries quickly and efficiently, without the complexities of establishing local entities. At G-P, we’re dedicated to breaking down barriers to global business and creating opportunities for everyone, everywhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our diverse, remote-first teams are essential to our success. We empower our Dream Team members with flexibility and resources, fostering an environment where innovation thrives and every contribution is valued and celebrated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The work you do here will positively impact lives around the world. We stand by our promise: Opportunity Made Possible. In addition to competitive compensation and benefits, we invite you to join us in expanding your skills and helping to reshape the future of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At G-P, we assist organizations in building exceptional global teams in days, not months—streamlining the hiring, onboarding, and management process to unlock growth potential for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;About The Position:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking an energetic, high-impact &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;41&quot;&gt;Talent Acquisition Partner&lt;/strong&gt; to join our global team. This is a full-lifecycle recruiting role requiring a strong balance of execution, candidate engagement, and cross-functional collaboration. You will focus on scaling our &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;283&quot;&gt;Technical teams (Software Engineering, IT, Product) alongside Go-To-Market (Sales, Revenue, Marketing) and corporate operations&lt;/strong&gt; across international markets. &amp;nbsp;Based in Ireland (or compatible EMEA hours), you will play a key role in connecting with candidates and hiring managers across regions, guiding candidates through complex global offer details and sales compensation structures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Full-Cycle Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Manage end-to-end recruitment across Technical (Engineering, Product, IT), GTM, and non-tech business functions—from kickoff alignment and targeted sourcing to interviewing, offer negotiations, and pre-onboarding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Sales Comp &amp;amp; Offer Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Confidently present and explain variable compensation models, including sales incentive plans, commission tiers, and quota structures to revenue-focused candidates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Global Compliance Navigation:&lt;/strong&gt; Work alongside local HR and legal guidelines to ensure offer letters, employment terms, and hiring checks comply with local country regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proactive Sourcing:&lt;/strong&gt; Use targeted sourcing techniques to identify and engage qualified passive candidates in competitive SaaS and professional services markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
