&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pipeline Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain real-time ATS hygiene to give leadership visibility into pipeline health and recruiting metrics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
