&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location &amp;amp; Time Zone:&lt;/strong&gt; Based in Ireland (or compatible EMEA hours) to align with global stakeholders and candidate pipelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
