&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Sales Incentive Familiarity:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to clearly walk sales and revenue candidates through variable incentive, OTE, and commission plan mechanics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
