&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(40, 40, 40); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Global Hiring Exposure:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct experience navigating cross-border hiring, international employment considerations, and local compliance checks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
