&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London or Bristol, UK (hybrid, three days a week in the office, with travel to client sites as required)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Level:&lt;/strong&gt; Solutions Architect TL2&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Commercial&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; £94,000 – £117,000 + discretionary bonus&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Head of Client Solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This role requires an existing right to work in the UK. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Pre-Sales Solutions Architect, you’ll sit at the intersection of technology and commercial strategy, shaping how prospective clients understand, adopt and succeed with the Kaluza platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Pre-Sales Consultants, you’ll lead the technical side of sales engagements, from deep-dive sessions on architecture and data models, through solution design, to handing off to implementation teams at contracting. No two engagements are the same: you might support early-stage prototypes, present at client sites, or advise our Product Architecture team on emerging market needs and common integration patterns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery and solution design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery workshops to understand current and target architectures, translate complex requirements into solution designs, and define each client’s “to-be” architecture and integration patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimate and hand off:&lt;/strong&gt; Estimate work packages so implementation programmes are set up for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tenders and proposals:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical input into tender responses and proposals, and deliver compelling technical presentations with product and technology teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proof of concept:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Pre-Sales Engineering to shape and design proof-of-concept exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the bridge between market demand and our engineering teams, so client needs shape the roadmap and proposed solutions align with core platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurable outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Advise clients on achieving measurable business outcomes through a data-driven approach, and help quantify the value of the platform in commercial conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a technologist with a strong focus on business outcomes, comfortable running deep technical sessions with architects and setting out a clear strategic vision to C-suite stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally, you’ll have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering complex enterprise software implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting and building systems, including some of: solutions on AWS, finance and billing platforms, and API technologies such as GraphQL and webhooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in regulated energy retail, particularly billing, metering and settlements systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills, able to distil complex concepts into clear, persuasive messages for a wide range of stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-centric, analytical approach, focused on solving the right problems and using data to measure success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity in a fast-paced environment, managing multiple workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation from the role technology plays in the global energy transition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience architecting SaaS solutions in the energy industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing large-scale, impactful software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or for a large energy retailer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five values guide how we work at Kaluza:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off and family:&lt;/strong&gt; 26 days’ holiday, plus flexible bank holidays (an extra 8 days to take whenever you like) and 26 weeks’ full pay for new parents, with no qualifying service period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health and security:&lt;/strong&gt; Private medical insurance with virtual GP, life assurance, pension scheme, free mortgage advice and eye tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay and flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, a Flex Fund of 5% [of salary] to spend on the benefits you want most, retail discounts through Perks at Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and setup:&lt;/strong&gt; Personal learning budget, home office budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Climate:&lt;/strong&gt; Furthr, our climate action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you. If you need any adjustments during the process, just let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, or read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt;Applicant Data Protection Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Senior Manager, HR Operations to lead our HR Operations function across Europe, Asia and LATAM. In this role, you&#39;ll translate global HR strategy into scalable programs, policies and service delivery standards while serving as a trusted advisor on complex governance and risk management across multiple international regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager, HR Operations, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategy and advisory.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll shape the roadmap for international HR operations, aligning global policy with local needs while acting as a trusted advisor to senior leaders across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead governance and compliance.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll manage end-to-end compliance across employment contracts, the employee lifecycle, global mobility, benefits, payroll and health and safety protocols across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize processes.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll leverage automation and AI to scale operational efficiency, manage vendor relationships and execute key initiatives like policy overhauls or M&amp;amp;A integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop team talent.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll directly manage our HR Operations Manager and coach the broader regional team, setting service-level standards and using metrics to showcase operational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Location&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We&#39;re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London or Barcelona. You&#39;ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced manager.&lt;/strong&gt; You bring 10+ years of HR operations experience, including at least five years managing teams in a global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International compliance expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; You have deep working knowledge of employment law, payroll, benefits and compliance across multiple countries, with strong experience in European regions like the U.K., Spain, Italy and the Netherlands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluent.&lt;/strong&gt; You have proven experience leveraging AI tools to optimize operations and improve workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process builder.&lt;/strong&gt; You excel at creating scalable, automated processes across complex regulatory landscapes while balancing hands-on execution with long-term strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaborator.&lt;/strong&gt; You build strong partnerships with Legal, Finance and IT, comfortably managing vendor negotiations and influencing senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multilingual.&lt;/strong&gt; Conversational or fluent Spanish skills are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Certified professional.&lt;/strong&gt; SHRM-SCP, GPHR or equivalent certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced degree.&lt;/strong&gt; Master&#39;s degree in HR, Business or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays and timeout (meeting-free) days, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you&#39;re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time, company-wide holidays and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too. Plus, every five years, we give you a paid sabbatical to unplug and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy.&lt;/strong&gt; We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re always investing in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech stack and hardware to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take care of your mental and physical health.&lt;/strong&gt; Medical plans tailored for you and your family—including vision, dental, and fertility benefits—and stay supported with our EAP and Employee Resource Groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to your 401(K).&lt;/strong&gt; Yep, that&#39;s free money. We&#39;ll match up to 4% of your own contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for a long-term incentive (LTI) award. Any bonuses awarded are based on individual and company performance paid at Hudl&#39;s discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£75,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£125,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title: Customer Enablement Specialist (12 Month Fixed-Term)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Paris&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: €42,400 - €53,000&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: Client Delivery EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To: Operating Model Design Lead&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is based in Paris, France and requires an existing right to work in the EU.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your application in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be a key driver of our mission to reimagine energy and make net-zero a reality for everyone. As a &lt;strong&gt;Customer Enablement Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be the bridge between our innovative technology and the people who use it. You will empower our clients, partners, and colleagues in French-speaking markets to not only understand our platform but to master it - including the AI-powered capabilities we are continuously building and rolling out. Your work will directly accelerate Kaluza&#39;s growth by ensuring our users are confident, capable, and ready to support the energy transition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Training &amp;amp; Programme Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted advisor to our clients, partners, and internal teams, performing deep learning needs analysis to understand their unique operational challenges. You&#39;ll manage your workstream with genuine project and programme management discipline - planning, sequencing and tracking delivery within complex, multi-stakeholder client programmes, ideally drawing on agile ways of working to stay responsive as scope evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Creation &amp;amp; Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; You will be the master of making the complex simple. You&#39;ll create high-quality, engaging training materials in both &lt;strong&gt;French&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, including interactive workshops, e-learning modules, and quick reference guides - translating not just today&#39;s platform, but AI features and products still in development, into training that&#39;s ready the moment they go live. You&#39;ll deliver these sessions virtually and in-person, inspiring your audience and building their confidence with every interaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving Adoption &amp;amp; Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Your role is to accelerate the adoption of the Kaluza platform. You will provide post-training support and coaching, monitor the effectiveness of your programmes, and continuously iterate based on feedback and performance metrics. You&#39;ll ensure our training leads to real-world, positive change for our users and the energy industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual Fluency, to a high standard:&lt;/strong&gt; You are fluent in both &lt;strong&gt;French&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt;, with outstanding written and spoken communication skills - essential for day-to-day stakeholder management across multiple countries, up to and including executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational &amp;amp; Technical SaaS Training Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record designing and delivering training in a SaaS or technology environment, ideally with hands-on experience of operational or technical instructional training rather than generalist L&amp;amp;D delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Programme Management Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong project and/or programme management experience gained within complex, multi-stakeholder environments; experience of agile delivery is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrable experience gained within an operational environment - energy sector operations and/or contact centre settings are especially valued - giving you a first-hand understanding of the pressures and workflows your training needs to support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrable experience building, productionalising, or delivering training on AI features and products while they are still in development, and genuine confidence working with AI tools as part of your own everyday practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplification Master:&lt;/strong&gt; You possess a natural ability to take complex technical and business concepts and translate them into clear, engaging, and practical learning materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engaging Facilitator:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a confident and dynamic presenter, able to captivate diverse audiences and create a fun, interactive learning environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative &amp;amp; Proactive:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a team player who builds strong relationships and is proactive in identifying opportunities to support others and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Energy Sector Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; A practical background in energy utility operations or decarbonisation technologies, beyond the operational experience above, that lets you connect training directly to the real-world challenges our clients face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Training Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A demonstrated track record of scaling training programmes and an ability to think strategically about how to build and expand a learning culture across an international organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Insurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Discretionary bonus, Alan Mutuelle Health Insurance, x3 Life &amp;amp; Death insurance (Prévoyance) via Alan, and standard Sécurité Sociale contributions (pension, family allowance, unemployment insurance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allowances:&lt;/strong&gt; 50% commuting expense reimbursement, €200 Home Working Allowance, and €150 Learning Fund&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days holiday + bank holidays + RTT days, Moments That Matter Leave, Compassionate Leave, two paid Volunteering Days, Flexible Working, and Career Break eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working in &lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure is seeking a Senior Content Writer with strong enterprise infrastructure expertise to join the Global Value Management team.&amp;nbsp;This role is responsible for developing high-quality, reusable, modular written content that enables the creation of compelling, enterprise-grade value propositions, proactive proposals and supporting technical, operational and commercial documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will apply your understanding of enterprise infrastructure architectures to synthesize complex technical, operational and commercial inputs from Product, Engineering, Value Consultants, Competitive Intelligence, CX, Partners and Sales into clear, structured customer narratives that articulate the business value of Pure solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the primary content writer within the team, you will help create and maintain the global master content library that underpins scalable proposal creation. You will enforce written content standards, ensuring outputs are governed, reusable and aligned to established messaging and quality standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Maintain Reusable Content&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own writing of defined technical, operational and financial value levers for Pure solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable modular components at multiple levels of detail (executive summary, standard narrative, detailed technical content).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create persona and industry aware variations of core narrative where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consume and adapt existing Pure content (case studies, product documentation, analyst endorsements, services materials) for structured proposal use.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and evolve global master content in alignment with roadmap priorities and release cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical and Value Writing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical, operational and financial inputs into clear value narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compile and synthesize inputs from cross-functional SMEs into customer-ready outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently engage SMEs to validate accuracy and secure approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance technical credibility with executive-level clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proposal Content Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop best practice placeholder content for: Value propositions, Proactive proposals and Technical/operational/commercial Appendices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure content demonstrates strong narrative flow, clarity and business value articulation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Select Engagements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in select live proposal engagements to refine standards and identify reusable content opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute written content for strategic proactive proposals where required.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standards &amp;amp; Quality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co own content standards &amp;amp; contribute to QA processes and structured release management for written content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear stakeholder communication and approval protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all outputs adhere to messaging, quality and governance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Technical Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of enterprise infrastructure technologies, with demonstrated experience writing about one or more of the following domains: (Enterprise storage (block, file, object), Compute and virtualization platforms, Hybrid cloud architectures, Data center, Infrastructure operations)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to confidently engage technical SMEs and interpret architectural and operational concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience synthesizing financial concepts into simple narrative form (taking input from SME’s not expected to have financial experience).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating multi solution portfolios and articulating integrated solution value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Writing Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written English skills, with the ability to produce precise, polished, executive ready content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience writing technical, solution or value-based content in an enterprise IT environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate complex technical, operational and commercial inputs into clear, customer facing narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building reusable, modular content or structured proposal components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive writing skills, including development of compelling summaries and structured appendices.&lt;/li&gt;
